    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d303">

                <pb facs="0364" n="1198" sameAs="frus:frus1918Supp01v02/pg1198"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 657.119/830a suppl.</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the
                        Ambassador in Great Britain</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Page</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1918-09-14T12:00:00-04:00">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">September 14, 1918, noon.</hi>
                        </date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>1365. For Sheldon [from
                    War Trade Board]:</p>
                <p>No. 1187. Supplementing Department’s 925, August 22, 8 p.m., our 1069.<anchor
                        n="2" xml:id="d303-f1"/> Please repeat the following to Dye: <quote rend="blockquote">
                        <p>Department’s 436, August 24, 5 p.m., our 52. Sheldon has sent us
                            corrected text of cork-makers’ agreement. It does not differ materially
                            from the former text submitted to us by Sheldon in his
                            despatch of June 7.<anchor n="1" xml:id="d303-f2"/> In consequence, you
                            are authorized to sign this agreement.</p>
                    </quote>
                </p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Lansing</hi>
                        
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
